  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v8-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "dcdc4e6a5572edebb3d58f68ffad13135377d602ffa37803842b0eb85c9b2da5",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7ba85d303e86e31eeec9728a5ad8bf5a76fa26049bf41ff22d6158d192864664",
      "text": "悟空和\n大红消防车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "741de5388e518dff9d5f532855320300f820030dcfbacfc9a5c90b5fb8c505c1",
      "text": "一辆大红消防车开过来。\n“哇，轮子好大呀！”\n悟空高兴得尾巴都翘起来了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9ff1a81bb6e63fe9d23266dfed19341bb4f08cf379b4456f1f8870441a7e0d42",
      "text": "到了消防站，本叔叔招招手。\n“来，带你们看看！”\n悟空的问题可多啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "117289a6de30f0c4eabc9e5ac18b56511f3173ff170e269f945d676e8866b278",
      "text": "“为什么穿大靴子？”\n“大靴子能保护我的脚。”\n悟空看看自己的鞋：\n“我的只会吱吱响！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "681c00ae57505a6bda55c3fd4499632cf462ecd37a82bdb36c827dc1a78f15b0",
      "text": "本叔叔给他一顶玩具头盔。\n帽子一滑，遮住了眉毛。\n“戴成这样，还看得见吗？”\n“那可不行！”本叔叔笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cdf4a5a030517c067777ed2e4ee56d4dc6b2f77386f35ec2cc5dbda33eb19a3e",
      "text": "本叔叔拿出一个特别的面罩。\n“戴上它，就能呼吸到\n干净的空气。”\n他的声音听起来不一样了！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2bdaf01b00a16896c2c772e40ea4a020cbdd709ddc709c787ba4e873adeae12f",
      "text": "“还是我呀！”本叔叔说。\n悟空也挥挥手：\n“咦，本叔叔！\n你的声音变啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f4e1bfe68b594e757c22aff332655703c5e6b7df0ddc3e7598d9f59fed8c5f5a",
      "text": "“那是一根大面条吗？”\n“是水带！”本叔叔说，\n“水就从这里流过去。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aed10ad7f727e066debf5c959085384c3c982306d789f59c040f5ead2abe9b66",
      "text": "本叔叔握住水带。\n哗——水喷了出来。\n啪嗒，一滴水\n落在悟空的鼻尖上。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "68d20850873598669fec321ecd5d7d1c46358c0fe3d6bb754aab566de3486a62",
      "text": "“那梯子呢？”\n“它帮我们爬到高处。”\n悟空站在下面，\n尾巴往上伸。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "de897e5a91e2bea7d76aa0e431697eba4d78e687f3ab9a75dc1750f45ade8386",
      "text": "接着，本叔叔拿出报警器。\n“嘀！嘀！嘀！”\n“这是警报声，在提醒大家。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c5392066b51c10b5f52fa86cba2dd881267a2f9c1bf68ced0b272c4f705bdcc0",
      "text": "“听到警报，就到外面去。”\n他们练习怎么走出去。\n“到了外面，就在那里等着，\n别再往里跑。”本叔叔说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d09f8cbfe93b1c7beb92a93358ce0c9a34c558a7a71dd79d57a3385e82ceff89",
      "text": "他们约好在一棵树下集合。\n“数数有几个鼻子！”悟空说。\n八戒把自己的鼻子数了两遍。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "568aa9e7ca0f7a2c394172e3d93adc8c694181e472c4b6a68590964153a54a3e",
      "text": "悟空向本叔叔道谢。\n“消防车真大！\n叔叔又能干，又热心！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "92c38d5a6232413e88f9d3fa49f676f414ac7b42e43b1d9e2629a43c02085509",
      "text": "回到家，玩具车响起来：\n呜哇……呜哇……\n声音小了，\n又小了……嘘。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "66a959585e6b4595c3e137e49f6966eeddc5b4559f6d7a633115e24a947829bd",
      "text": "他给玩具车盖好被子。\n“晚安，小帮手们。”\n房间安静下来了，\n悟空也安静下来了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
